<Slide style={{ padding: 0, background: '#FFFFFF' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 72, background: '#1E4FA8', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>03 · 内容三层模型：知识、操作、方法是三件事</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, paddingTop: 14, paddingBottom: 12, paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
            很多产品只有知识点标签一层，于是「考了什么知识」与「该用什么方法」被混为一谈。
        </Text>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12, flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', gap: 16, height: 96, background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 14 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 52, height: 52, background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 6, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>知识</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 4 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>categories.yaml · 541 个三级知识点</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>回答：这道题用了什么知识。12 个板块 / 100 个二级分类。</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 210, alignItems: 'flex-end', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#8B97A8', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>所有 AI 输出都要回表校验</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', gap: 16, height: 96, background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 14 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 52, height: 52, background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 6, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>操作</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 4 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>steps.yaml · 12 个题型的步骤表</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>回答：这一步做什么。题型 → 一级步骤 → 二级步骤。</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 210, alignItems: 'flex-end', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#8B97A8', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>非法步骤名会被重置</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', gap: 16, height: 96, background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #3D7BD9', padding: 14 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 52, height: 52, background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 6, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>方法</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 4 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>routine_catalog.json · 288 条套路</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>回答：何时用这个方法、容易与哪个搞混。</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 210, alignItems: 'flex-end', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#8B97A8', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>含 exclusions 与 confusable_ids</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 14, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4, width: 250 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>同一道题的三层标注</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#8B97A8', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>三者不可互相替代</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12 }}>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', borderRadius: 6, padding: 10 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#8B97A8' }}>知识</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>导数</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', borderRadius: 6, padding: 10 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#8B97A8' }}>操作</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>求导并讨论符号</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', borderRadius: 6, padding: 10 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#8B97A8' }}>方法</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>构造差函数证明不等式</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 8, padding: 12, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 32, background: '#FFC107' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.5, flex: 1 }}>
                区分「不会这个知识」与「选错了方法」，是能够做错因归因的前提。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 44, paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F7F9FC', borderTop: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>高中数学 AI 学习系统 · 技术框架汇报</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>14 / 24</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
